{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Arial;}}\f0\fs22 RPA Local - installation notice\par\par
This installer contains a new local launcher and unchanged third-party RPA components. The original vendor's source code is not included. No license to the vendor components is granted by this project. Use and redistribution remain subject to the applicable vendor and third-party terms.\par\par
The installer is for the current Windows user and requires .NET Framework 4.8. Runtime files are expanded to the user's LocalAppData folder. Uninstall removes the installed launcher and shortcuts; it preserves runtime profiles and user projects.\par\par
Legacy projects require their complete project folders, including flow, script and resource files. Browser, Office and other integrations may require additional software and compatible versions.\par}
